OL,3,GNEWSAHotel shouldn't have been used for
OL,4,Aasylum seekers - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prestigious Victorian hotel should
OL,7,Fnot have been used to house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers, a government minister has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Royal Hotel in Hull was used by the
OL,12,FHome Office to house asylum seekers for
OL,13,Fmore than six years. It was the focus
OL,14,Fof a riot in August 2024.
OL,16,FDuring a visit on Wednesday, Anna
OL,17,FTurley, minister for border security
OL,18,Fand asylum, said the site needed to be
OL,19,Freinstated as "a key part" of the
OL,20,Fcity's tourism offer, either as a place
OL,21,Fto stay or other community use.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
